  <ul>
    <li><strong>Title:</strong> eltrm Premium Subscription (name may vary in App Store)</li>
    <li><strong>Length:</strong> Monthly, 6 Months, or Annual</li>
    <li><strong>Price:</strong> Displayed in the App Store at the time of purchase</li>
