    <li>Subscriptions automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.</li>
    <li>Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period.</li>
    <li>You can manage or cancel your subscription in your <strong>Apple ID Account Settings</strong>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>No refunds are provided for unused portions of a subscription period.</p>

